    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3778123b1545226056823b2a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你还记得吗？我们之前在抽奖时抽中，\n却被神明硬是延后了1年的\n那个温泉旅行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5434a1056c747e6787b5511b0db5c1a75396ac03af2ffb4c7e932915e4b823bc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056112.json",
      "json_path": [
