    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65dcf31a4f4d27c4b5235dc3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我原本只觉得她这么兴奋地大吵大闹，\n是因为她是“祝贺巫女”的关系。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d25143effc20ba36ea4a1795c95e2226a578d4f41efab1e303ea6696ccc584c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
