      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为差不多要满一年了，\n我又跑去抽签，\n结果在“旅行”那栏是这么写的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a129566d75ecf197a3421b04141098fe0ef13ab7396ea7df9b06d83f66d9db25",
